Package: evolution-groupwise
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, evolution (>= 3.52), evolution-data-server (>= 3.52)
Description: GroupWise mailboxes in Evolution
 Access to GroupWise mailboxes from Evolution through the SOAP interface of
 the GroupWise Post Office Agent: mail, address books, calendar, tasks and
 notes, with invitations answered and sent by GroupWise itself.
 .
 Contains the Camel provider, the address book and calendar backends of
 evolution-data-server, the collection backend of the source registry, the
 account assistant page for Evolution and the command line tool gw-cli.
